1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:13,010
This is Guest Management, a module of the NEWEAST Intranet. Open it from the Intranet, or go to guest.neweast.cloud.

2
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:26,340
Any employee, in any department, can raise a visit. Watch the role on screen. That tells you which part of the module you are in.

3
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:42,980
The requester asks. The line manager approves. Reception prepares. Marketing handles a gift if asked. HR prepares a gate pass if asked. The guard welcomes the guest.

4
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:57,140
Chapter one. The requester raises a visit. The line manager must approve it before Reception can prepare.

5
00:00:57,190 --> 00:01:16,880
Requester — This is the visit form. Set the date, arrival time, department, and the purpose.

6
00:01:16,930 --> 00:01:43,750
Requester — Set the number of guests. The form opens one card per guest. Name, mobile, and email are required.

7
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:59,020
Requester — Ask only for what you need. Here we request a driver, a welcome gift, and a gate pass.

8
00:01:59,070 --> 00:02:15,170
Requester — Submit. The request goes to the line manager first.

9
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:28,250
Requester — History shows the live status. It is with the line manager, waiting for approval.

10
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:38,110
Chapter two. The line manager reviews the request and decides.

11
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:48,990
Line manager — Open Approve. Waiting requests sit here.

12
00:02:49,040 --> 00:03:09,820
Line manager — Read the guests, add a short comment, and approve.

13
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:19,490
Line manager — Approved. Reception can now prepare the visit.

14
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:31,630
Requester — History updates after approval. The visit is now with Administration.

15
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:44,410
Chapter three. Reception, Marketing, and HR prepare what was asked.

16
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:56,030
Reception — Staff requests arrive in one inbox. Open the visit.

17
00:03:56,080 --> 00:04:12,800
Reception — Choose a free meeting room, and assign the driver.

18
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:34,970
Reception — Mark the driver done, then confirm to book the room in Outlook.

19
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:50,070
Reception — A gift is waiting. Marketing prepares it before Reception marks it done.

20
00:04:50,120 --> 00:05:06,440
Marketing — Gift requests open here. Approve so the gift moves to Preparing.

21
00:05:06,490 --> 00:05:24,120
Marketing — The gift is preparing. Reception will mark it done when it arrives.

22
00:05:24,170 --> 00:05:37,360
Reception — The gift is ready. Mark it done.

23
00:05:37,410 --> 00:05:52,690
Reception — A gate pass is waiting. HR prepares it, the same way Marketing prepares a gift.

24
00:05:52,740 --> 00:06:08,440
HR — Gate pass requests open here. Approve so the pass moves to Preparing.

25
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:24,240
HR — The gate pass is preparing. Reception will mark it done when it is in hand.

26
00:06:24,290 --> 00:06:39,180
Reception — The gate pass is ready. Mark it done, then send the party to the guard.

27
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:53,460
Reception — Submit to Security puts both guests on today’s list at the gate.

28
00:06:53,510 --> 00:07:04,490
Chapter four. Book a room only. No visitor request is needed.

29
00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:22,390
Reception — Click a free slot, set the subject, and book in Outlook.

30
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:31,320
Reception — The meeting is on the rooms board. Invitees can be added on the card.

31
00:07:31,370 --> 00:07:42,170
Chapter five. The guard. Check the guest in, then check the guest out.

32
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:53,950
Guard — Today’s list shows who is expected. The QR reader is for invitation codes.

33
00:07:54,000 --> 00:08:05,680
Guard — Open the visit to record entry.

34
00:08:05,730 --> 00:08:16,960
Guard — Check in. Both guests are now inside Headquarters.

35
00:08:17,010 --> 00:08:46,800
Guard — When the visit ends, check out. Same visit, same desk.

36
00:08:46,850 --> 00:08:54,450
Guard — Done. The guest is on the record from arrival to departure.

37
00:08:54,500 --> 00:09:02,780
Guest Management, on the NEWEAST Intranet. Ask. Approve. Prepare. Welcome.
